    "code": "O",
    "quote": "To study the effect of the noise on the performance of the Detrended Fluctuation Analysis (DFA) and the proposed method, we considered an additive zero-mean white Gaussian noise with a variable standard deviation (σ) to simulate the different levels of the noise.",
